/t/p/original/zfASs4kqXPL7CmRWmqjJovwjfsu.jpg"},{"id":563570,"name":"Cristian Valencia","role":"Iván","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1CJyr00qifpyVcb5c8pgfy1cjSJ.jpg"},{"id":1414862,"name":"Bernat Saumell","role":"Javi","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lTCdFcOtLswXrY69IngUpaVpMIw.jpg"},{"id":936220,"name":"Albert Carbó","role":"Pau","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1pSyGB0ilQurK0UMMNA0cKcMciH.jpg"},{"id":1915009,"name":"Henry Morales","role":"Celador 1","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5VoW5agohI5yMVgqpC7oVaIOsG8.jpg"},{"id":1580449,"name":"Daniel Aser","role":"Celador 2","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qbPEqiaMGRagSPR0c2aayPJIHRZ.jpg"},{"id":81160,"name":"Belén Fabra","role":"Nurse 1","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sn53sEt3VJN4gagzJiDC8sMYjBx.jpg"},{"id":1170451,"name":"Montserrat Miralles","role":"Nurse 2","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2OFbG66UfAdi7CD4LAfVw0bG0a8.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Il corpo di Anna Fritz","overview":"Anna Fritz è un’attrice famosa molto bella, considerata una delle donne più desiderate al mondo. Improvvisamente muore. Pau lavora come inserviente presso l’ospedale in cui Anna Fritz è stata portata. Lui è un giovane timido e introverso e spesso, quando il corpo di una giovane donna viene portato all’obitorio, non può fare a meno di guardarlo. Lo stesso accadrà con il cadavere di Anna: il giovane scatta una foto del suo corpo nudo e la invia al suo amico Ivan. Ivan e Javi vanno a far visita in ospedale a Pau e un po’ ubriachi non resistono alla tentazione di dissacrare il corpo morto di Anna Fritz...."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Corpse of Anna Fritz","overview":"Anna Fritz is a beautiful and famous actress. Suddenly her body is found in a hotel and the news of her death goes around the planet. The young, shy caretaker Pau works at the hospital where they carried the body of Anna Fritz. He and his friends  decide to take pictures of the body of Anna Fritz.  They decide they could make love to her and nobody would know. They are in front of Anna Fritz ... and can do with it what  they want."},{"language":"es-ES","title":"El cadáver de Anna Fritz","overview":"Anna Fritz, una joven y famosa actriz de cine, es hallada muerta en la suite de un hotel. Pau trabaja como celador en el hospital a donde han trasladado el cadáver. Es un chico tímido e introvertido que cada vez que entra en el depósito el cadáver de una chica atractiva, no puede evitar mirarla. Hace una foto a Anna Fritz y se la envía a dos amigos. Cuando éstos llegan a la morgue, se quedan fascinados por su gran belleza. Víctimas de sus instintos más primitivos, se plantean violarla impunemente, pero no saben en qué clase de infierno se van a precipitar.","tagline":"Sus instintos los van a llevar a un infierno."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hJaC0mBzPQxlm6ZngJAhgytEtHj.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fMt4fwqy0C908DwHDHpn65z1ku0.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":323372,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wbGlMrymGFhYE8CTDVc7xwPUD6j.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wbGlMrymGFhYE8CTDVc7xwPUD6j.jpg","language":"en","width":500,"height":751},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wbGlMrymGFhYE8CTDVc7xwPUD6j.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wbGlMrymGFhYE8CTDVc7xwPUD6j.jpg","language":"en","width":500,"height":751},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sb9trbG2gBVeYudlytbhhQeu4Eb.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sb9trbG2gBVeYudlytbhhQeu4Eb